## Unity Version & Packages
- Unity 6000.3.9f1, URP 17.3.0
- Netcode for GameObjects (NGO) 2.9.1 — use `NetworkBehaviour`, `NetworkVariable<>`, RPCs
- UGS: Authentication, CloudSave, CloudCode, Leaderboards, RemoteConfig, Analytics
- LeanTween for tweening/animation
- TextMeshPro for all UI text
- EasyTransition for scene transitions
- AYellowpaper.SerializedCollections for dictionary serialization in ScriptableObjects

## Project Constraints
- **No namespaces** — all C# classes in global namespace
- **PascalCase** for class names, filenames must match class names exactly
- **No spaces** in file or folder names
- **Singletons** use `public static ClassName Instance { get; private set; }` in Awake
- **ScriptableObjects**: create via `[CreateAssetMenu]`, store in Resources or referenced directly

## Code Style
- Fields: `_camelCase` for private, `[SerializeField] private` for serialized
- Properties: PascalCase
- Async methods: suffix `Async`, return `Task`, include `CancellationToken` parameter
- No XML doc comments — use `[ContextCodeAnalyzer]` attribute for annotations
- Avoid regions; prefer partial classes near 400-line limit

## File Organization
- One class per file (file name = class name)
- System-specific folders under `Assets/Scripts/Runtime/`
- Legacy code in `Assets/Scripts/{System}_Scripts/` — prefer editing Runtime versions

## MCP Tool Usage
- `com.coplaydev.unity-mcp` (IvanMurzak) installed
- Enable only the tool categories needed for the current task
- Disable unused tools to save token budget
